---
---

<section class="section" id="router">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-tag">Model-Agnostic Intelligence</div>
      <h2>Dynamic Category-Based Model Router</h2>
      <p>
        The harness is never hardcoded to any single LLM vendor. Agents route work by <strong style="color: #fff;">task category</strong> rather than model name, dynamically ranking candidates across both local hardware nodes and cloud providers.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-2">
      <!-- Category Breakdown -->
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="chip chip-cyan" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">// WORKLOAD CATEGORIES</div>
        
        <div class="category-item">
          <div class="cat-head">
            <span class="cat-name">rlm-primary</span>
            <span class="cat-tier">CONTROLLER & REASONING</span>
          </div>
          <p class="cat-desc">Primary REPL loop, deep architecture reasoning, and complex task orchestration.</p>
          <div class="cat-models">
            <span>tell: qwen3.5:9b (score: 96.5)</span>
            <span>amdy: deepseek-v4-pro / gpt-4o (remote fallback)</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="category-item">
          <div class="cat-head">
            <span class="cat-name">rlm-worker-fast</span>
            <span class="cat-tier">HIGH-VOLUME EXTRACTION</span>
          </div>
          <p class="cat-desc">Parallel sub-tasks: web search aggregation, BM25 filtering, text formatting, and RAG chunking.</p>
          <div class="cat-models">
            <span>amdy: qwen2.5-coder:1.5b (score: 98.0)</span>
            <span>tell: glm-4-flash / qwen2.5:3b</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="category-item">
          <div class="cat-head">
            <span class="cat-name">rlm-worker-heavy</span>
            <span class="cat-tier">DEEP IMPLEMENTATION</span>
          </div>
          <p class="cat-desc">Recursive code generation, AST refactoring passes, and unit test battery creation.</p>
          <div class="cat-models">
            <span>amdy: qwen2.5-coder:7b (score: 95.0)</span>
            <span>tell: deepseek-r1:8b (score: 89.5)</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="category-item" style="border-bottom: none; margin-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0;">
          <div class="cat-head">
            <span class="cat-name">rlm-vision</span>
            <span class="cat-tier">MULTIMODAL PERCEPTION</span>
          </div>
          <p class="cat-desc">UI artifact analysis, architecture diagrams, and screenshot inspection.</p>
          <div class="cat-models">
            <span>amdy: bakllava:latest (score: 92.5)</span>
            <span>tell: minicpm-v:8b / moondream:1.8b</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Routing Principles & Flow -->
      <div class="panel panel-solid">
        <div class="chip chip-danger" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">// LOCAL-FIRST POLICY</div>
        <h3 style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem; color: #fff;">Zero Cloud Substitution Law</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
          Autonomous agent routines are strictly confined to local GPU models. Cloud models (Claude Sonnet 3.7, Gemini 2.5 Pro, OpenAI) require explicit operator authorization via <code style="color: var(--color-text-highlight);">escalate_cloud</code>.
        </p>

        <div class="routing-flow-box">
          <div class="flow-step">
            <div class="step-num">01</div>
            <div>
              <div class="step-title">Category Classification</div>
              <div class="step-sub">Task classified into router category (Fast, Heavy, Primary, Vision)</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flow-step">
            <div class="step-num">02</div>
            <div>
              <div class="step-title">Hardware Fit Verification</div>
              <div class="step-sub">Checks VRAM capacity on amdy (8GB) and tell (6GB)</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flow-step">
            <div class="step-num">03</div>
            <div>
              <div class="step-title">Local Execution & Failover</div>
              <div class="step-sub">Dispatches to top-ranked local model; auto-fails to peer node if busy</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flow-step">
            <div class="step-num">04</div>
            <div>
              <div class="step-title">Task Trail Journaling</div>
              <div class="step-sub">Execution duration, token consumption, and score logged to Task Trail & Kùzu Graph</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .category-item {
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-primary);
  }

  .cat-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .cat-name {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-highlight);
  }

  .cat-tier {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .cat-desc {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .cat-models {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .cat-models span {
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .routing-flow-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .flow-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    background: var(--color-bg-base);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-primary);
    clip-path: polygon(6px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 6px), calc(100% - 6px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 6px);
  }

  .step-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-text-highlight);
    background: rgba(0, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-active);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.45rem;
  }

  .step-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  .step-sub {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
  }
</style>
